385c85.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75803-1-9-2","ko":"잠깐만 기다려. 동전 주머니에서 꺼내 줄게.","zh":"稍等，我从零钱袋里拿给你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐만","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠깐만","audio":"/audio/c8821cc6e56a5df2a36e.mp3"}},{"text":"기다려.","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다려","audio":"/audio/45f50f6f6dc05f2c8c0a.mp3"}},{"text":"동전","meaning":"硬币","explanation":"동전：硬币。","readings":[{"term":"동전","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48655","senseId":"1","lemma":"동전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동전","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3"}},{"text":"주머니에서","meaning":"口袋，袋子","explanation":"주머니：口袋，袋子；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"주머니","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75803","senseId":"1","lemma":"주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주머니에서","audio":"/audio/64c8c0c328636d54b403.mp3"}},{"text":"꺼내","meaning":"拿出，掏出，取出","explanation":"꺼내다：拿出，掏出，取出；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"꺼내다","audio":"/audio/eda7321c0e7ec22a3cbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62265","senseId":"1","lemma":"꺼내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꺼내","audio":"/audio/ddfc4555bb606057b4d2.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","o